    "title": "In Loving Memory of Odelia M. Vigil - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Odelia M. Vigil, a cherished resident of Pueblo, Colorado, passed away on January 4, 2026, at the age of 93. Odelia graduated from Aguilar High School. She was a wonderful homemaker and loving mother. Her family was the center of her world, and she was known for her devoted love and care for her husband, children, grandchildren, and great-grandchildren. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
